</header><div class="absolute top-0 start-0 w-full h-px pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div><main role="main" id="main" tabindex="-1" class="focus-visible:outline-none"><section class="grid gap-y-2xl grid-cols-full pb-4xl bg-section-dark-bg text-section-dark-text pt-4xl" data-section-name="" data-component-name="hero" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="dark"><div class="container grid grid-cols-4 sm:grid-cols-8 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-gutter gap-y-2xl" data-component-name="section-header"><div class="col-span-4 xs:col-span-4 sm:col-span-8 md:col-span-10 lg:col-span-8 xl:col-span-8 xs:col-start-1 sm:col-start-1 md:col-start-2 lg:col-start-3 xl:col-start-3"><div class="text-center text-section-dark-text" data-mode="dark" data-component-name="heading-group"><h1 class="richtext text-t1 text-balance">Shopify Legal</h1><div class="richtext text-body-lg opacity-body pt-sm">Here are some important things to know about using Shopify</div></div></div></div></section><section class="grid gap-y-2xl grid-cols-full pb-4xl bg-section-light-bg text-section-light-text pt-4xl" data-section-name="" data-component-name="terms" data-viewable-component="true" data-mode="light"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-gutter gap-y-xl sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 container" data-component-name="card-grid"><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Merchant Terms of Service</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">The terms you agree to when you use Shopify</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/terms">View merchant terms</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/shop-pay-merchant-terms">View Shop Pay merchant terms</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/eu-terms">View E.U. based merchants supplementary terms of service</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/dpa">View data processing addendum</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/terms-faq">View terms of service frequently asked questions</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Shopify Payments Terms of Service</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">The terms you agree to when you use Shopify Payments</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/terms-shopify-payments">View Shopify Payments terms</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/terms-shopify-protect">View Shopify Protect terms</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/terms-cryptocurrency-credit-reward-program">View Cryptocurrency Credit Reward Program terms</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Shopify API License and Terms of Use</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">The terms you agree to when you use the Shopify APIs</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/api-terms">View Shopify API license terms</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/app-events-terms">View App Events API terms</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Acceptable Use Policy</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">Activities that are prohibited in connection with use of the Shopify Services.</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/aup">View Acceptable Use Policy</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/tools/report-an-issue/report-a-merchant">Report an issue with a merchant</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Privacy & Data Protection</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">How we collect and process personal information</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/privacy">View privacy policy</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/cookies">View cookie policy</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/gvtaccesspolicy">View guidelines for legal requests for information</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/binding-corporate-rules">Shopify&#x27;s Binding Corporate Rules</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Intellectual Property</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">Steps to take if you believe someone using our platform has infringed your intellectual property rights</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="https://help.shopify.com/en/legal/dmca">View copyright policy and report copyright infringement</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="https://help.shopify.com/en/legal/trademark-infringement">View trademark policy and report trademark infringement</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/patents">Information about Shopify&#x27;s Patents</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/trademarks">Information about Shopify&#x27;s Trademarks</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Partner Terms of Service</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">The terms you agree to when you become a Shopify Partner</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/partners/terms">View partner terms</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/tools/report-an-issue/report-a-partner-violation">Report a partner violation</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Financial Products</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">Submit a complaint if you're dissatisfied with Shopify Balance, Credit, Capital or Shop Pay Installments</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/tools/report-an-issue/financial-complaint">Submit a financial complaint</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Shopify Fulfillment Network Terms of Service</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">The terms you agree to when you use the Shopify Fulfillment Network</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/terms#9-additional-services">View fulfillment network terms</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Shopify Gift Card and Store Credit Terms</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">The terms you agree to when you use Shopify Gift Cards or Store Credit</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="leading-8 inline-block mr-1 after:content-[&#x27;_,_&#x27;] after:inline-block last:after:content-none"><a href="/legal/terms-gift-cards">View terms</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">Legal Notices</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">Important legal compliance information</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/dsa">Digital Service Act</a></li><li class="leading-8 inline-block mr-1 after:content-[&#x27;_,_&#x27;] after:inline-block last:after:content-none"><a href="/legal/p2b/legal-notices">Legal notices</a></li><li class="block mt-sm"><a href="/legal/p2b">Submit a P2B complaint</a></li></ul></nav></div><div><div class="text-start text-section-light-text" data-mode="light" data-component-name="heading-group"><h2 class="richtext text-t5 text-balance">POS Equipment Agreement and Return Policies</h2><div class="richtext text-body-base opacity-body pt-2">The terms you agree to when you purchase POS Equipment</div></div><nav><ul class="richtext mt-sm"><li class="leading-8 inline-block mr-1 after:content-[&#x27;_,_&#x27;] after:inline-block last:after:content-none"><a href="https://hardware.shopify.com/en-ca/pages/return-policy">Canada (EN)</a></li><li class="leading-8 inline-block mr-1 after:content-[&#x27;_,_&#x27;] after:inline-block last:after:content-none"><a href="https://hardware.shopify.com/fr-ca/pages/return-policy">Canada (FR)</a></li><li class="leading-8 inline-block mr-1 after:content-[&#x27;_,_&#x27;] after:inline-block last:after:content-none"><a href="https://hardware.shopify.com/pages/return-policy">US</a></li><li class="leading-8 inline-block mr-1 after:content-[&#x27;_,_&#x27;] after:inline-block last:after:content-none"><a href="https://hardware.shopify.com/en-uk/pages/return-policy">UK</a></li><li class="leading-8 inline-block mr-1 after:content-[&#x27;_,_&#x27;] after:inline-block last:after:content-none"><a href="https://hardware.shopify.com/en-ie/pages/return-policy">Ireland</a></li><li class="leading-8 inline-block mr-1 after:content-[&#x27;_,_&#x27;] after:inline-block last:after:content-none"><a href="https://hardware.shopify.com/en-au/pages/return-policy">Australia</a></li><li class="leading-8 inline-block mr-1 after:content-[&#x27;_,_&#x27;] after:inline-block last:after:content-none"><a href="https://hardware.shopify.com/en-sg/pages/return-policy">Singapore</a></li><li class="leading-8 inline-block mr-1 after:content-[&#x27;_,_&#x27;] after:inline-block last:after:content-none"><a href="https://hardware.shopify.com/en-nz/pages/return-policy">New Zealand</a></li></ul></nav></div></div></section></main><footer class="relative py-20 px-8 gap-y-14 font-sans max-sm:flex max-sm:flex-col sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-x-gutter sm:px-margin md:grid-cols-5 xl:px-auto-xl bg-black text-[#a1a1aa]" data-component-name="footer"><a href="#main" class="w-11 h-[50px] text-white" aria-label="Back to the top"><svg class="pointer-events-none w-full h-full"><use href="#logo-shopify-bag"></use></svg></a><ul class="gap-y-14 max-sm:flex max-sm:flex-col max-sm:pb-2 sm:col-span-2 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-gutter md:col-span-4 md:grid-cols-4"><li><h3 class="text-xl leading-[20px] font-medium mb-6 text-white">Shopify</h3><ul class="flex flex-col gap-y-4"><li><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="/blog/what-is-shopify">What is Shopify?</a></li><li><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="/editions">Shopify Editions</a></li><li><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="https://www.shopify.com/careers">Careers</a></li><li><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="https://www.shopify.com/investors">Investors</a></li><li><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="https://www.shopify.com/news">Newsroom</a></li><li><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="/climate">Sustainability</a></li></ul></li><li><h3 class="text-xl leading-[20px] font-medium mb-6 text-white">Ecosystem</h3><ul class="flex flex-col gap-y-4"><li><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="https://shopify.dev/docs">Developer Docs</a></li><li><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" href="https://themes.shopify.com/">Theme Store</a></li><li><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-white" hre